WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:01.817
ANTHONY MACKIE
With the Dora Milaje,

00:00:01.817 --> 00:00:03.048
I didn't know what to expect.

00:00:03.643 --> 00:00:05.643
SEBASTIAN STAN
There's something magical about it all.

00:00:07.532 --> 00:00:09.373
KARI SKOGLAND
The Wakandans are back

00:00:09.373 --> 00:00:11.218
and they brought
so much to the party.

00:00:12.262 --> 00:00:13.386
FLORENCE KASUMBA
When we show up,

00:00:13.386 --> 00:00:14.942
you don't know
how many are around.

00:00:14.942 --> 00:00:15.569
[Laughing]

00:00:15.593 --> 00:00:16.791
JOHN WALKER
Put down the pointy sticks

00:00:16.791 --> 00:00:17.966
and we can talk this through.

00:00:17.966 --> 00:00:19.685
ANTHONY MACKIE
There's a confidence...

00:00:22.664 --> 00:00:24.180
...and all of us
get out of the way.

00:00:24.204 --> 00:00:24.900
SEBASTIAN STAN
Yeah!

00:00:25.673 --> 00:00:27.152
WYATT RUSSELL
You can only do so much!

00:00:29.109 --> 00:00:30.572
SAM WILSON
You should do something.

00:00:30.770 --> 00:00:35.070
KARI SKOGLAND
He realizes how vulnerable he is.

00:00:35.095 --> 00:00:37.048
Is he going to take
the super soldier serum?

00:00:37.072 --> 00:00:38.538
WYATT RUSSELL
That decision...

00:00:39.524 --> 00:00:40.873
...is crushing.

00:00:41.524 --> 00:00:42.917
SAM WILSON
We're going to need all hands on deck

00:00:42.917 --> 00:00:44.488
for whatever's coming next.

00:00:44.488 --> 00:00:46.963
FLORENCE KASUMBA
I'm so excited to see the outcome.

00:00:47.202 --> 00:00:49.256
KARI SKOGLAND
We are not spoiling anything.

00:00:49.281 --> 00:00:50.265
[Laughing]

00:00:50.289 --> 00:00:51.583
BARON ZEMO
I'm sure it will all come to

00:00:51.583 --> 00:00:53.183
an agreeable conclusion.

